OL,3,ABrazil's Congress approves shorter
OL,4,Aworking week in win for Lula
OL,5,
OL,6,FLula's supporters are hoping that its
OL,7,Fpassage, which is estimated to benefit
OL,8,Fmore than 30 million workers, will
OL,9,Fboost his chances of closing in on his
OL,10,Fright-wing rival, Flavio Bolsonaro, in
OL,11,Fthe 25 October run-off.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
